  "body": "Follow-up of PR #2433 (issue #2286). The review verdict was \"no blockers\". The items below are not blocking.\n\nDone means: each item below is done or refused with a reason in a comment. The touched tests pass. No touched file is over 400 lines.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Split `crates/app/tests/setup_align_multiaxis.rs` (469 lines). Move the mill-turn refusal test `all_ten_multiaxis_and_rotary_kinds_stay_refused_on_aligned_mill_turn` into a file of its own.\n- [ ] Split `crates/app/src/setup_align.rs` (457 lines) along the domain seam. The file is over 400 lines.\n- [ ] Add the oblique-turn check `[35, 25, 40]` to the 8 kinds that run only `[90, 0, 90]`. Only `Contour5D` and `MultiAxisContour` run the oblique check now.\n- [ ] Mount the machine before generation for `RotaryContour` and `RotaryOffset`. Both kinds now generate with no machine mounted. They mount `tilthead.mch` only before the post.\n",
